{"kind":"charness.bounded_review.v1","lens":"issue-resolution: resolution/recurrence and per-target behavioral observations","packet_sha256":"7958a9c5e4a203efc2fd6369a22c64cd6c6b1ad53c58e82cc37ac7d48e3c81a7","reviewed_input_identity_sha256":"c0dece1f852a40b5b7feaf6190bb262f393af04252241ded1235d5bf45f07ec7","verdict":"pass","target_observations":[{"target":"corca-ai/charness#817","verdict":"pass","summary":"The reviewed contents repair the reader-facing adapter contract and add focused recurrence protection for the specialized-lane command passthrough behavior.","evidence":["skills/public/release/references/adapter-contract.md requires the planner to report the declared `command` verbatim and never recompose argument forwarding.","The contract includes the concrete failure example: rewriting `pnpm run release:candidate:dispatch --source-sha <sha>` as `pnpm run release:candidate:dispatch -- --source-sha <sha>` introduces a rejected literal leading `--`.","tests/quality_gates/test_release_run_planner.py adds `test_release_run_planner_reports_declared_lane_command_verbatim`, using `pnpm run release:candidate:dispatch --source-sha abc123` and asserting exact equality between the declared command and the planner payload.","The regression test separately asserts that `-- --source-sha` is absent from the reported command and pins the contract wording plus the malformed separator example."]}],"findings":[],"counterweight_triage":[{"concern":"The supplied packet contains test source but no test-execution result.","bin":"non-blocking residual","disposition":"The requested contents-based recurrence review is supported by a focused executable regression test and the matching contract wording; this review does not claim that the test suite was executed."},{"concern":"The test describes byte-identical passthrough while comparing decoded Python strings.","bin":"not a blocker","disposition":"For the ASCII pnpm-shaped command at issue, exact string equality pins every character and preserves the relevant separator and argument-forwarding shape."}],"next_move":"Accept the issue-resolution slice; run the focused planner regression in the implementation verification lane before merge if execution evidence has not already been recorded.","non_claims":["No test command was executed as part of this bounded review.","No behavior outside the two identity-bound reviewed paths was assessed.","No hosted workflow execution, tag trigger, or release approval behavior is claimed.","Goal evidence lineage is not goal-bound."]}
